        "timestamp": 1789788537
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>specifically, this:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Elixir\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"nc\">Header</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">Header</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">is_eq</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"nc\">Data</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">Data</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">is_eq</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>...needs to be this:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Elixir\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nc\">Header</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">Header</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">is_eq</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nc\">Data</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">Data</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">is_eq</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
